<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/velqi-logo-crown.png">
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Ro'yxatdan O'tish | VELQI</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
  <script>document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'dark');</script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/components.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/enhancements.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

<div class="auth-page">
  <div class="auth-left">
    <div style="max-width: 440px; color: white;">
      <div style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">🎓</div>
      <h1 style="color: white; font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">Yangi marralarni zabt eting</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; opacity: 0.9; line-height: 1.7;">
        VELQI-da hisob oching va kiberxavfsizlik (150 000 so'm/soat), AI, Node.js, Frontend va Dizayn kurslarini qulay o'rganing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="auth-right">
    <div class="auth-card">
      <h2 class="auth-title">Ro'yxatdan O'tish 📝</h2>
      <p class="auth-subtitle">Bir necha soniyada yangi hisob oching</p>

      <form id="registerForm">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">To'liq Ismingiz</label>
          <div class="input-group">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-user input-icon"></i>
            <input type="text" id="name" class="form-control" placeholder="Ali Valiyev" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Email Manzili</label>
          <div class="input-group">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope input-icon"></i>
            <input type="email" id="email" class="form-control" placeholder="nomingiz@misol.uz" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Telefon Raqami</label>
          <div class="input-group">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-phone input-icon"></i>
            <input type="tel" id="phone" class="form-control" placeholder="+998 90 123 45 67">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Parol (kamida 6 ta belgi)</label>
          <div class="input-group">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-lock input-icon"></i>
            <input type="password" id="password" class="form-control" placeholder="••••••••" required>
            <button type="button" class="input-toggle"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i></button>
          </div>
          <div style="background:var(--border); height:4px; border-radius:2px; margin-top:6px; overflow:hidden;">
            <div id="strengthBar" style="height:100%; width:0%; transition:all 0.3s;"></div>
          </div>
          <span id="strengthText" style="font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--gray);"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Parolni Tasdiqlang</label>
          <div class="input-group">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-lock input-icon"></i>
            <input type="password" id="confirmPassword" class="form-control" placeholder="••••••••" required>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <label style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:0.85rem; cursor:pointer;">
            <input type="checkbox" id="agreeTerms" checked required>
            <span>Men <a href="/terms" style="color:var(--primary);">foydalanish shartlari</a>ga roziman</span>
          </label>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; padding: 13px; font-size: 1rem;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-user-plus"></i> Ro'yxatdan O'tish
        </button>
      </form>

      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 24px;">
        Allaqachon hisobingiz bormi? <a href="/login" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Kirish</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
<script src="/js/auth.js"></script>
<script src="/js/i18n-dict.js"></script>
<script src="/js/i18n.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
